  "issues": [
    {
      "issue": "R1: The Receipt add button (in SimpleAddButtons) is rendered as regular PrimaryButton components positioned absolutely, but the bottom offset is calculated as `TAB_BAR_HEIGHT + insets.bottom + space(2)`. This does not account for the height of the button itself (56dp) plus any required gap, so the button can still overlap the bottom of the recent activity list when scrolling.",
